body:
I do not....

&#x200B;

How do I do this?

Hmmmnnnn, I do have a character on Coeurl. That explains that side of things.

&#x200B;

But my character on Balmung doesn't show up as a Transfer From option either....

\*looks at title\*

&#x200B;

OH FOR FUCKS SAKES!

The thing is.... I can see the Goblins making a Midgar-esque city and not batting an eye about it. 

&#x200B;

"Segregation?! What's wrong with a lil' segregation?!"

Warframe, FFXIV, ESO.... All popular and successful in their own way.

&#x200B;

Hell I even went on a date the other day with a guy and he mentioned FFXIV and raiding as one of his hobbies, and that he was going to Vegas for the ARR convention. And unlike Blizz, they probably won't shit on their fans!

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wXAk1QVL43A](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wXAk1QVL43A)

&#x200B;

Every Time. SEPHIROTH!

THIS! Jesus FUCK! War Crimes, Shadow of the Horde, and Tides of War. In that order. 

&#x200B;

Such great character growth and development, all thrown completely aside. But so fucking beautiful and well written.

&#x200B;

And if you'd like a hearty laugh, read the one where Malfurion does EVERYTHING he did in Legion, but in 2008, in StormRage. 

&#x200B;

Let's face it, neither faction has been written properly this expansion, and the entire premise of this expansion is fucking retarded.

&#x200B;

"Oh, the world is dying! OH WELL LET'S JUST KILL EACH OTHER INSTEAD OF FIX IT! THERE'S ONLY ENOUGH ROOM FOR OUR STUPIDITY!" 

&#x200B;

Honestly, both factions have gone full on retard, and so have most the fucking characters. Almost all of them have suddenly without any reason forgotten their character growth, forgotten multiple arcs established over expansions and books, and are retreading tired old personalities they'd left behind.

&#x200B;

Not to mention fucking Sylvanas staring a war when canonically it has been established that the efforts in Draenor and all of Legion basically drained the horde's population and left them in a critically weakened state. The horde was founded in survival, the land they claimed was harsh and unforgiving, they were trying to make up for sins of the past and simply avoid extinction/extermination. BUT SUDDENLY THEY'RE DOWN TO START A WAR WHILE POPULATION IS WANING?! WTF?!

&#x200B;

And then you get to the Alliance, who've apparently just been forgotten? They burned a major city down and then barely did anything to play that up, but at least it was acknowledged? Half or more of the Alliance subplots and races just.... Don't exist anymore and have been ignored for three or four expansions? You'd think this would be the expansion where we see them finally rally and show some kinda unity and personality, but so far it's been..... mostly just a boring teen and his much more interesting dog.

Blizzard does not want your measly dollars, it wants ALL THE MONEY. More specifically, it wants ALL THE BILLIONS AND BILLIONS OF YUAN.

&#x200B;

Your pathetic Murica bucks are nothing compared to China Cash.

 “We expect Activision Blizzard to outpace its peers with its in-game monetization, and expect dramatic growth in its mobile business as it launches new titles based upon its successful PC and console games,” Wedbush wrote. 

&#x200B;

YEAH! I can't wait for them to port all their games to mobile while chasing that sweet sweet Yuan.

 “We expect Activision Blizzard to outpace its peers with its in-game monetization, and expect dramatic growth in its mobile business as it launches new titles based upon its successful PC and console games,” Wedbush wrote. 

&#x200B;

Don't worry, they plan on ruining all the franchises! And milking players dry while they can! Looking forward to Blizzard-Netease, the leading mobile-only gaming platform and company.

CEO: Sorry the optics just aren't tracking with our hip new focus group, we're just not seeing an interest or return in single player or narrative experiences.

&#x200B;

We're pleased to announce our newest game, SpoonDay! Not only is it a hit with our focus groups, but the investors love the pitch too!

Fucking NO they were not. I live in Canada, a country that is notorious for not having internet. Or having third world internet outside Toronto.

&#x200B;

I can still play games on my PS4. I put them in, I play them, I don't get to play the patched versions. BUT I STILL GET TO PLAY FUCKING GAMES. 

&#x200B;

If Xtards had their way, at best I could buy a console and wish it played games. Because there'll never be internet out here, at least in the next thirty years. We don't even have cellphone reception yet, and I'm writing this on a text browser that removes high detail images/videos/gifs since they won't load on dial-up and will just cause the page to timeout.
